    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0245",
      "reading_order": 290,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.984999999999985,
        "t": 504.30901953125,
        "r": 558.2909999999999,
        "b": 483.86433441674615
      },
      "content": "When the appliance is not connected to an equipotential bonding system, there is a risk of electric shock from touching live parts.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_289",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_289",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 18,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0246",
      "reading_order": 291,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.99399999999992,
        "t": 480.07201953124996,
        "r": 558.633,
        "b": 459.3843344167461
      },
      "content": " Make sure that any work on the electrical system is performed solely by a qualified electrician from an authorized service company.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_289",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_289",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 18,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0247",
      "reading_order": 292,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.976000000000056,
        "t": 455.34901953124995,
        "r": 547.6890000000002,
        "b": 446.9013344167461
      },
      "content": " Make sure that the electrical connections are intact and connected securely before putting the appliance into use.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_289",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_289",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 18,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0248",
      "reading_order": 293,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.949000000000126,
        "t": 443.22601953124996,
        "r": 558.4620000000001,
        "b": 422.5383344167461
      },
      "content": " Before preparing the appliance for use, make sure that the appliance, including all metallic accessories, is connected to an equipotential bonding system.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_289",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_289",
