        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 265.62601953125,
        "r": 393.1919999999999,
        "b": 257.53833441674624
      },
      "content": "The appliance is fitted with one frequency converter (FC) and EMC mains input filters.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_295",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
